      "description": "Refreshes tokens for an allowed account. Invalid token401; banned/deactivated/suspended403. Current service does not explicitly check refresh type claim; security regression should require rejection of an access token.",
      "source": "identity-service/src/main/java/com/kirenz/identity_service/auth/controller/AuthController.java"
    },
